Changes made in this fork include:
- Renamed the extension and replaced its icon (the MultiPost name and logo are not used).
- Added a built-in publishing console (src/tabs/console.tsx, src/console/) for
  Xiaohongshu, Threads, X, TikTok and YouTube.
- Toolbar icon and first-install page open the built-in console instead of multipost.app.
- No external website is trusted by default; removed paiban.md from externally_connectable.
- Added YouTube login detection (src/sync/account/youtube.ts).
